From f0fdc20c6004eb4c6fb2be4d006fba80037e47f4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Weidong Sun <sunweidong@linux.alibaba.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 15:29:21 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] alibabacloud: wait for instance deletion to complete

Reconcile accepted and ambiguous deletion outcomes against the exact
instance ID. Bound polling by the caller context, retry documented
transitions, and preserve definitive API failures.

Co-authored-by: Codex <noreply@openai.com>
